* OFTPPRM0 - OFTPD monitor settings
*
* KEYWORD=VALUE, blanks or commas between them, '*' in column 1
* starts a comment. Columns 73-80 are ignored.
*
* ODETTEID     this installation's Odette ID (required)
* PORT         OFTP port for calls from partners          (3305)
* CONTROLPORT  port of the OFTP utility, 0 = none          (3306)
*              NO SECURITY during development: anyone who can
*              reach this port can queue and list transfers
* INPREFIX     received files are INPREFIX.<virtual name>  (OFTP.IN)
* TMPPREFIX    files while being received                  (OFTP.TMP)
* MAXSESS      sessions at a time                          (4)
* SDEB         exchange buffer, 128..8192                  (4096)
* CREDIT       buffers before a credit, 1..999             (99)
* TIMEOUT      seconds to wait for the partner             (60)
* RETRY        seconds before a refused send is retried    (300)
* TLRECL       LRECL of received text files (VB)           (255)
* UBLKSIZE     BLKSIZE of received unstructured files (U)  (6144)
* UNIT, VOLSER where received files are allocated    (system's choice)
* RELAY        Y: act as a node: take files for Odette IDs of our
*              partners (direct or VIA) and pass them on unchanged,
*              their EERP/NERP back to the sender               (N)
*
ODETTEID=O0000000000MYMVS
PORT=3305 CONTROLPORT=3306
INPREFIX=OFTP.IN TMPPREFIX=OFTP.TMP
